<newsitem itemid="194095" id="root" date="1996-11-15" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: GAN nine-month sales rise.</title>
<headline>GAN nine-month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					40,810    vs   37,239</p>
<p>    - Non life France			   10,914    vs   10,740</p>
<p>    - life insurance and funds France     18,594    vs   15,648</p>
<p>    - GAN international			 11,302    vs   10,850</p>
<p>THIRD QUARTER</p>
<p>    Turnover					12,314    vs   11,445</p>
<p>    - Non Life France			    3,511    vs    3,221</p>
<p>    - life insurance and funds France	5,422    vs    5,051</p>
<p>    - GAN international			  3,381    vs    3,173</p>
<p>NOTE - GAN gave the figures in the BALO official bulletin. It said its nine month insurance sales were up 9.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
